@page "/projects"

<PageTitle>Projects - Luke Hammer</PageTitle>

<h1>Projects</h1>
<p class="lead">Things I've built and am building. Each one has a short summary and a link.</p>

<div class="row g-3">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h4 card-title">Lucky Luke Magic</h2>
            <p class="card-text">My main magic website. Family-friendly magic shows in Vancouver, WA and Portland, OR, with everything you need to learn about the show and book it.</p>
            <a href="https://luckylukemagic.com/" target="_blank">luckylukemagic.com</a>
        </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h4 card-title">Capture Checklist</h2>
            <p class="card-text">A photo shoot planner for a whole team. Plan the shots you need, share the plan, and check each one off as it is captured.</p>
            <a href="https://capturechecklist.com/" target="_blank">capturechecklist.com</a>
        </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h4 card-title">Show Planner</h2>
            <p class="card-text">An online planner for magicians. Keep your repertoire in one place, build set lists, and print packing lists, music cues and practice sheets.</p>
            <a href="https://proud-stone-029a7db1e.4.azurestaticapps.net" target="_blank">Open Show Planner</a>
        </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h4 card-title">Greg Moreland's website</h2>
            <p class="card-text">A fresh rebuild of the website for magician Greg Moreland, with his show dates and shop. This is a preview while it is being finished.</p>
            <a href="https://gregmoreland-preview.azurewebsites.net/" target="_blank">View the preview</a>
        </div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-6">
        <div class="card h-100"><div class="card-body">
            <h2 class="h4 card-title">ShowStill <span class="badge bg-secondary align-middle fs-6">In development</span></h2>
            <p class="card-text">A Windows app that watches a long performance video and picks out the best moments for marketing photos. You can then fine-tune each pick and save it at full quality.</p>
        </div></div>
    </div>
</div>

